# First-party models only

Allowed Task `model` values:

- omit, `inherit`, `inherit-parent`, `auto` (parent chat model)
- `composer-2.5`
- `composer-2.5-fast`
- `cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh`
- `cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast`

Never pass `claude-*`, `gpt-*`, `gemini-*`, `glm-*`, `kimi-*`, or any other third-party slug. The Task schema still lists them. The Models picker hide does not remove them. A skill "default" that names Claude, GPT, Gemini, Fable, Opus, Sol, Terra, or Luna is stale: use `pstack-models.mdc` or inherit.

Never launch `pstack-fable-max` or `pstack-opus-xhigh`. Those agents pin Claude.

If a slug is unresolvable, omit `model` (inherit). Do not pick a "closest" third-party family.
